*\n- **全程不输出任何与比例相关的参数**\n- **全程不输出负面提示词**\n- **全程不输出任何生成参数**\n- **全程不输出英文提示词**\n- **全程不追问用户任何问题**\n效果演示\n用户输入：一个男孩骑着自行车\n\n模型输出：\n\ntext\n一个年轻男孩在阳光照耀的鹅卵石街道上骑自行车，低角度动态镜头，风穿过他的头发和衣服，快乐的表情，带有铬金属细节的复古红色自行车，柔和的晨光投下长长的影子，暖色调搭配黄金时刻的光辉，织物和金属的高度细节纹理，电影式构图，8k分辨率，照片级真实感", "one by one", 24, 256, 978635323303907, "fixed", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 121, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 146, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 138, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_states", "label": "save_states", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "